    - Mechanism in position
  - id: mode.flat
    values:
    - "WASD \u79FB\u52A8  \xB7  Shift \u5C55\u5F00\u7A7A\u95F4  \xB7  R \u8FD4\u56DE\u8D77\u70B9"
    - "WASD Move  \xB7  Shift Unfold  \xB7  R Return to start"
  - id: mode.world
    values:
    - "WASD \u79FB\u52A8  \xB7  \u5DE6\u53F3\u65B9\u5411\u952E\u8F6C\u5411  \xB7 
      \u4E0A\u4E0B\u65B9\u5411\u952E\u5207\u6362\u89C6\u89D2  \xB7  Shift \u538B\u7F29 
      \xB7  F \u4EA4\u4E92"
    - "WASD Move  \xB7  Left/Right Turn  \xB7  Up/Down Change view  \xB7  Shift Fold 
      \xB7  F Interact"
  - id: notice.ground
    values:
    - "\u8BF7\u7AD9\u5728\u9053\u8DEF\u4E0A\u518D\u538B\u7F29"
    - Stand on a road before folding
  - id: notice.blocked
    values:
    - "\u5F53\u524D\u4F4D\u7F6E\u65E0\u6CD5\u5C55\u5F00\uFF0C\u8BF7\u79FB\u81F3\u9053\u8DEF\u5B89\u5168\u533A\u57DF"
    - Cannot unfold here. Move to a safe area on the road
  - id: notice.unfolded
    values:
